{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/10725kbe","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"Developer proposes SQL; trusted Python selects five mandatory suites. Git constructs a merge after base advancement. Oracle executes migration and greeting code in a generated schema.\n\nResult aggregation binds merge, tree, cadence and policy. No model inference or optional critical suite is involved.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
