{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ojidkrel","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"A1 smoke, A2 unit, A3 integration and full B1/B2 regression passed. Eight real paths: three passing cadences and five rejected fault paths.\n\nLocal PR simulation is not a GitHub Testing status. Prepared-host administrator transport is not production isolation. Native PROJECT deployment, interrupted cleanup and new-host reproduction remain separate obligations.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
